  {
   "id": "R26-base-0005",
   "text": "If a protruding part of the lamp's external surface (e.g. an exposed seal/gasket of TPE or silicone, or an edge with radius < 2.5 mm) is made of a material of hardness not exceeding 60 Shore A, it may have a radius of curvature less than 2.5 mm; the hardness shall be measured with the component as installed on the vehicle, and where a Shore A measurement is impossible, comparable measurements shall be used for evaluation.",
   "table": null,
   "regulation": "UN R26",
   "version": "4.0.0",
   "role": "base",
